# gate-transition drives core/scripts/gate-transition.sh, which shells to its siblings in core/scripts/;
# the mutant and gate-3 stub trees are whole copies of that directory. The story world is
# story-evidence-scaffold's build_world (world.sh sources he-inproc.sh beside it), and the lead checkout
# carries artifact-path-grammar.md, which partition-review-diff.sh resolves under .claude/skills/ai-dlc/.
!core/scripts/gate-transition.sh
core/scripts/
core/fixtures/story-evidence-scaffold/
core/fixtures/lib/
core/skills/ai-dlc/artifact-path-grammar.md
# JOIN drives the real dispatch guard (!) with this tree's implementation.md copied into the guard's project.
!core/hooks/ai-dlc-dispatch-guard.sh
core/skills/ai-dlc/steps/implementation.md
